# License

**⚠️ License decision pending.**

The PulseID project has not yet made a licensing decision. This placeholder
is tracked to keep the repository structure complete; it does not grant any
rights.

The license will be chosen and this file replaced when:

- The project is confirmed to be open source (and which license — e.g., MIT,
  Apache-2.0, AGPL-3.0 — fits the intended use), **or**
- A proprietary license / no-license posture is decided for the project.

Until then, all rights are reserved and no license is granted.

---

This placeholder exists only because the planning documents
(`docs/PRODUCT_REQUIREMENTS.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`)
do not specify a license. No licensing decision should be inferred from the
mere presence of this file.